30. FINAL STATEMENT

This task demonstrated the development of an explainable content-based restaurant recommendation system that processes restaurant information, matches user preferences, calculates content similarity, incorporates restaurant ratings, ranks suitable restaurants, and generates Top N recommendations.

The implementation provides a practical example of how machine learning and natural language processing techniques can be combined with rule-based filtering to create a useful restaurant recommendation system.